        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick a spot, drop a pixel, and see what happens.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/eeadcc037085624383c9d08b927c68f2.avif?t=1758568368\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thousands of people are painting on the same grid, shaping and reshaping it in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every mark counts, whether it’s part of a huge mural or just a single dot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/465711a34d409a4936d2d84bf3545b9e.avif?t=1758568368\" width=616 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">👀 Watch the canvas change live as others draw alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">⏳ Place a pixel, wait for your timer, then go again - planning matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">🤝 Join friends or public groups to defend your space or build something bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">⚔️ Fight for territory, collaborate on art, or quietly slip in your own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/2aefcfc0f3dbf316ac949ead09bb41df.avif?t=1758568368\" width=616 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The grid is open. Will you create, defend, or destroy?</h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick a spot, drop a pixel, and see what happens.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/eeadcc037085624383c9d08b927c68f2.avif?t=1758568368\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thousands of people are painting on the same grid, shaping and reshaping it in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every mark counts, whether it’s part of a huge mural or just a single dot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/465711a34d409a4936d2d84bf3545b9e.avif?t=1758568368\" width=616 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">👀 Watch the canvas change live as others draw alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">⏳ Place a pixel, wait for your timer, then go again - planning matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">🤝 Join friends or public groups to defend your space or build something bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">⚔️ Fight for territory, collaborate on art, or quietly slip in your own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/2aefcfc0f3dbf316ac949ead09bb41df.avif?t=1758568368\" width=616 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The grid is open. Will you create, defend, or destroy?</h2>",
